        "text": "<@U02E4DAQGSZ> This is really cool thanks for sharing! Do you think this will be affected by the recent changes around third party harnesses that are now required to use API instead of subscription?  <https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47633396|https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47633396> ",
